Lyric references are retrieved from [LRCLIB](https://lrclib.net) under
`reference_policy: lrclib_assumed_gold` (see `README.md` →
[LRCLIB as the annotation source](README.md#lrclib-as-the-annotation-source)).
LRCLIB is a public API; using it does not grant redistribution rights to the
lyric text it returns, which is why `data/references/` is gitignored and
never committed. The same machine-readable table above is tracked at
`data/manifest.csv`.
